    "text": "Prove that $(\\sin\\theta + \\operatorname{cosec}\\theta)^2 + (\\cos\\theta + \\sec\\theta)^2 = 7 + \\tan^2\\theta + \\cot^2\\theta$.",
    "answer": "Proved",
